     1,
     "Is matplotlib working for you in other respects? There are different backends\r<br>that one might use.\r<br>\r<br>For example, does\r<br>\r<br>import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\r<br>plt.plot([1,2,3])\r<br>\r<br>Produce anything? If not, then you&#39;ll need to figure out how to get matplotlib\r<br>working in the first place. The installation instructions are platform specific.\r<br>\r<br>Best,\r<br>\r<br>-a\r<br>"
    ],
